   "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farming Simulator 25 邀請你加入收穫滿滿的農村生活。不論是一手打造你的傳奇，或是在多人遊戲中合作，你的農場由你決定！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300320/extras/15a356885415bc0fcc959c125bef1697.poster.avif?t=1788874602\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300320/extras/15a356885415bc0fcc959c125bef1697.webm?t=1788874602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300320/extras/15a356885415bc0fcc959c125bef1697.mp4?t=1788874602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >這是屬於你的農場！</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >沿著北美的蜿蜒河流和古樸的穀物升運機、在中歐池塘的圍繞之下，或在滿是霓虹燈的東亞港口城市附近的鬱蔥稻田景色中，建立你的農場。種植作物、照顧牲畜、發展林業，管理農業王國的農產品店、生產與建設！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300320/extras/11bacb76ee6b79390fb5dfe6311e5105.poster.avif?t=1788874602\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300320/extras/11bacb76ee6b79390fb5dfe6311e5105.webm?t=1788874602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300320/extras/11bacb76ee6b79390fb5dfe6311e5105.mp4?t=1788874602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >多變的天氣，受氣候影響的地形變化</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >龍捲風和冰雹帶來新的挑戰，農夫必須做好準備，評估它們對作物的影響。胎痕帶來的影響會使地面變形，還有豐富的新天氣效果，讓你的農場景色更浪漫真實。一天將從陽光穿透樹頂開始，金黃色的光芒照亮早晨的霧氣！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300320/extras/43ec238fbcc8945ad1587980623f90a9.poster.avif?t=1788874602\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300320/extras/43ec238fbcc8945ad1587980623f90a9.webm?t=1788874602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300320/extras/43ec238fbcc8945ad1587980623f90a9.mp4?t=1788874602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >亞洲農業、新的作物和牲畜</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在能蓄水的稻田中種植兩種稻米，或是種植菠菜、豌豆和綠豆。Farming Simulator 25 提供更多作物選項，共有 25 種，各種樹木加上溫室蔬菜帶來更豐富的多樣性。新增亞洲農業，你可以操作新類型設備穿越田地，圍欄和牧場除了牛、綿羊、豬、雞、馬等牲畜，還有強壯的水牛和山羊加入，甚至包括牲畜幼崽！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300320/extras/1b6352b95e7293cf1bb29dc8648f0c54.poster.avif?t=1788874602\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300320/extras/1b6352b95e7293cf1bb29dc8648f0c54.webm?t=1788874602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300320/extras/1b6352b95e7293cf1bb29dc8648f0c54.mp4?t=1788874602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >真實的機具，GPS 已啟動！</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >利用 GPS 導航和更進步的自動化更精準地耕作。操作超過 150 個國際頂級品牌的 400 多種真實機具和工具，包括 Case IH、CLAAS、Fendt、John Deere、Kubota、Massey Ferguson、New Holland、Valtra 等等。選擇你最愛的品牌或是探索超棒的新科技！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300320/extras/09fec49e9c3b0dc72dbdf9a927f144bc.poster.avif?t=1788874602\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300320/extras/09fec49e9c3b0dc72dbdf9a927f144bc.webm?t=1788874602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300320/extras/09fec49e9c3b0dc72dbdf9a927f144bc.mp4?t=1788874602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >農業生活改良</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >全面技術升級，你會感受到和田地與大自然產生更深的連結。利用最新的 GIANTS Engine 10 強化圖像和物理運算，提供更精緻的體驗。Farming Simulator 25 提升操作性並改良介面功能，最適合剛要展開新生活的新手，資深農夫更能盡情享受。如果這樣還不夠，請從遊戲中的 ModHub 下載經過開發者測試的玩家創作內容！</p>",
   "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farming Simulator 25 邀請你加入收穫滿滿的農村生活。不論是一手打造你的傳奇，或是在多人遊戲中合作，你的農場由你決定！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300320/extras/15a356885415bc0fcc959c125bef1697.poster.avif?t=1788874602\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300320/extras/15a356885415bc0fcc959c125bef1697.webm?t=1788874602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300320/extras/15a356885415bc0fcc959c125bef1697.mp4?t=1788874602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >這是屬於你的農場！</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >沿著北美的蜿蜒河流和古樸的穀物升運機、在中歐池塘的圍繞之下，或在滿是霓虹燈的東亞港口城市附近的鬱蔥稻田景色中，建立你的農場。種植作物、照顧牲畜、發展林業，管理農業王國的農產品店、生產與建設！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300320/extras/11bacb76ee6b79390fb5dfe6311e5105.poster.avif?t=1788874602\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300320/extras/11bacb76ee6b79390fb5dfe6311e5105.webm?t=1788874602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300320/extras/11bacb76ee6b79390fb5dfe6311e5105.mp4?t=1788874602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >多變的天氣，受氣候影響的地形變化</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >龍捲風和冰雹帶來新的挑戰，農夫必須做好準備，評估它們對作物的影響。胎痕帶來的影響會使地面變形，還有豐富的新天氣效果，讓你的農場景色更浪漫真實。一天將從陽光穿透樹頂開始，金黃色的光芒照亮早晨的霧氣！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic